      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would make impersonation very easy, users with large followings already have enough problems with people pretending to be them.\nIf this is seriously considered then a twitter style verification system would be a necessity. Then verification brings on its own set of problem, just as the ranking system does.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
