      "value": "@{5f2cc09ac00297464bd2dd84|full_name}: If it can be implemented in a way that protects creators then yes, go for it.\nBefore I was an outlier I was just a creator making things, id never ask or even expect another creator to go through what i have just because something they made became popular.\nYou are right that I am an outlier, but I just cant see the system you are proposing, working in practice.",
